sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Attendee
  participant W as Web app
  participant R as Relayer
  participant U as Test USDC
  participant B as Bail
  A->>W: RSVP
  W->>W: create ticket key (and implicit account key)
  W->>R: faucet(account)
  R->>U: storage_deposit + ft_transfer 1 USDC
  W->>W: sign delegate action: ft_transfer_call(Bail, 1 USDC, note)
  W->>R: meta(signed delegate)
  R->>U: relay (pays gas and 1 yoctoNEAR)
  U->>B: ft_on_transfer(note)
  B-->>W: rsvp event
  W-->>A: You're in, seat 12
